title: Asylum and Refugee Reception
subtitle: Begin with a European solidarity settlement and an end to pushbacks; humanitarian access is a fallback, not a first rung.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_major_reform_card
frequency: 130
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_asylum_reform_timer <= 0 and asylum_reform_settled = 0 and asylum_on_slate = 1 and reform_pressure_pending = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.poland_asylum_reform_timer = 3;
Q.asylum_reform_next_stage = Number(Q.asylum_reform_proposal_stage) || 4;
// The hardest ladder in the game: the field starts with a clear public
// majority against us and an organised backlash on top of it.
const thresholds = [0, 30, 46, 66, 88];
Q.asylum_reform_threshold = thresholds[Q.asylum_reform_next_stage];
const ministryBonus =
    (Q.interior_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 11 : 0) +
    (Q.foreign_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 7 : 0);
const koCabinet = Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslCabinet = Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050Cabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayCabinet = pslCabinet || p2050Cabinet;
let partnerBonus = 0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    partnerBonus = -35 + Number(Q.asylum_pis_commitment) * 6;
} else {
    partnerBonus =
        (koCabinet
            ? Number(Q.ko_relation) * 0.08 +
                Number(Q.ko_accept_rights) * 0.08 +
                Number(Q.asylum_ko_commitment) * 6 - 8
            : 0) +
        (thirdWayCabinet
            ? Number(Q.asylum_third_way_commitment) * 5 - 6
            : 0);
}
const palaceBonus =
    Number(Q.president_relation) * 0.06 +
    (Q.asylum_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.asylum_palace_commitment) * 6
        : 0);
const publicBonus =
    (Number(Q.refugee_solidarity_support) - 40) * 0.40 +
    Number(Q.migration_empathy) * 0.14 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_poll) - 5) * 0.45 -
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.refugee_solidarity_backlash) - 50) * 0.18 -
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.migration_disinformation) - 40) * 0.14;
Q.asylum_reform_power = Math.round(Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        140,
        Number(Q.asylum_reform_progress) * 0.62 +
        partnerBonus + palaceBonus + publicBonus + ministryBonus +
        (Q.asylum_referendum_mandate ? 18 : 0) -
        Number(Q.eu_progressive_headwind)
    )
));
Q.reform_ceiling_issue = "asylum";
Q.reform_ceiling_target = Q.asylum_reform_next_stage;
!}
call: poland_reform_ceiling
card-image: img/poland/cards/crisis-compact.webp

= Asylum as a whole-game project

**Campaign goal:** [? if asylum_reform_defined: [+ asylum_reform_goal_label
+].?][? if not asylum_reform_defined: Not yet defined.?]
[? if asylum_reform_defined: **Bill currently on the table:** [+
asylum_reform_next_label +].
**Passage power:** **[+ asylum_reform_power +]**; tabling this bill needs **[+
asylum_reform_threshold +]**.
**Settlement ceiling:** [+ reform_ceiling_tier_label +] — [+
reform_ceiling_reachable_label +].
[? if reform_ceiling_blocker_kind != "none": Binding veto player: **[+
reform_ceiling_blocker_name +]** — scores the bill [+
reform_ceiling_blocker_score +] against the [+ reform_ceiling_need +] a tier-[+
reform_ceiling_target_resolved +] settlement needs.?]
[+ reform_ceiling_breakdown +].?][? if not asylum_reform_defined: The first
project action must define the ambitious bill before preparation or bargaining
can begin.?]

This is the field where the Left is furthest from the country. Nobody in the
cabinet gains votes from it, the border is a security argument before it is a
humanitarian one, and every partner reads the polling before the file.

[? if refugee_solidarity_support < 45: A minority position cannot be legislated
by insisting. Either the public argument moves first, or the settlement stops at
procedure and legal aid.?][? if refugee_solidarity_support >= 50: The field has
turned. A lawful procedure is now defensible in public, which is what changes a
partner's arithmetic.?]

[? if migration_disinformation > 45: An organised disinformation campaign is
running on this field. Every point of public support costs more than it should.?]

- @define_goal
- @draft
- @coalition_round
- @cash_relation
- @ministry
- @palace
- @referendum
- @advance

@define_goal
title: Define the goal as a European solidarity settlement
subtitle: An end to pushbacks, a lawful procedure and reception capacity enter as one opening demand.
view-if: asylum_reform_defined = 0
on-arrival: asylum_reform_defined = 1; asylum_on_slate = 1; asylum_reform_goal_stage = 4; asylum_reform_proposal_stage = 4; asylum_reform_next_stage = 4; asylum_reform_progress += 12; progressive_credibility += 3; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 10; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 11; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_left_ownership += 8; news_headline = "Lewica defines an end to pushbacks as its asylum bill"

Naming the endpoint costs us in the polling and buys the one thing this field
never has: a position that does not move every time a convoy reaches the wire.

- #poland_card_finish

@draft
title: Keep the lawyers, medics and municipal officers drafting
subtitle: Free. Preparation +10.
view-if: asylum_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: asylum_reform_progress += 10; migration_empathy += 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 3; news_headline = "Lewica keeps a lawful asylum procedure ready for the next opening"

Border lawyers, emergency medics and the mayors who actually house people turn
a moral position into a procedure with staffing numbers.

- #poland_card_finish

@coalition_round
title: Put the asylum file on a partner's table
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Choose KO, [+ third_way_display_name +] or PiS and record one commitment.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A serious negotiating round needs one resource.
view-if: asylum_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @round_ko
- @round_third_way
- @round_pis

@round_ko
title: Ask KO to record a legal-access floor at the border
on-arrival: resources -= 1; asylum_reform_progress += 8; asylum_ko_commitment += 1; ko_relation += 3; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 8; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 4; news_headline = "KO records a border legal-access floor"

KO records that a person who reaches the strip is entitled to a procedure. It
stops well short of the reception system we drafted, and a floor written into a
coalition annex is harder to abandon during the next border panic.

- #poland_card_finish

@round_third_way
title: Make [+ third_way_display_name +] name the reception it would fund
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
on-arrival: {! Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 5; Q.public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 4; Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 2; Q.resources -= 1; Q.asylum_reform_progress += 8; Q.asylum_third_way_commitment += 1; Q.psl_relation += 2; Q.p2050_relation += 3; Q.news_headline = Q.third_way_display_name + " records a limited asylum-procedure compromise"; !}

[+ third_way_display_name +] names the reception it would actually pay for —
beds, interpreters, a decision timetable — while keeping every word of its
language about control. A funded minimum outlives an unfunded principle.

- #poland_card_finish

@round_pis
title: Open a humanitarian-access channel with PiS
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and government_party = "pis") or pis_relation >= 25 or national_crisis_pressure >= 30
unavailable-subtitle: PiS will not record an asylum commitment without coalition ties or acute national pressure.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; asylum_reform_progress += 5; asylum_pis_commitment += 1; pis_relation += 2; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 7; public_mood_pending_border_security_salience += 5; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 3; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 6; news_headline = "PiS concedes a narrow humanitarian-access channel"

PiS concedes access for medics and lawyers in defined cases and nothing at all
about the pushbacks. Border voters hear firmness maintained; the humanitarian
organisations see the first door in the wall.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_relation
title: Cash in a party relationship instead of spending a resource
subtitle: Choose a 58+ relationship; it falls by 12 and becomes one recorded commitment.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 58 or pis_relation >= 58 or ((p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1) and (psl_relation >= 58 or p2050_relation >= 58))
unavailable-subtitle: No potential governing partner trusts us enough yet.
view-if: asylum_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @cash_ko
- @cash_third_way
- @cash_pis

@cash_ko
title: Spend KO goodwill on a lawful asylum procedure
choose-if: ko_relation >= 58
on-arrival: ko_relation -= 12; asylum_ko_commitment += 1; asylum_reform_progress += 10; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 10; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 5; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 4; news_headline = "Lewica converts KO goodwill into an asylum-procedure commitment"

The goodwill converts into a written procedure rather than another shared
statement of values. KO's leadership carries the harder half of that story back
to its own border-county deputies.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_third_way
title: Spend [+ third_way_display_name +] goodwill on reception capacity
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
choose-if: psl_relation >= 58 or p2050_relation >= 58
on-arrival: {!
if (Number(Q.psl_relation) >= Number(Q.p2050_relation)) {
    Q.psl_relation -= 12;
} else {
    Q.p2050_relation -= 12;
}
Q.asylum_third_way_commitment += 1;
Q.asylum_reform_progress += 10;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 8;
Q.public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 3;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica converts " + Q.third_way_display_name + " goodwill into reception capacity";
!}

[+ third_way_display_name +] buys the reception capacity with its own budget
credibility, which is the part of the file no declaration could ever supply.
The relationship pays for the beds.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_pis
title: Spend PiS goodwill on humanitarian access
choose-if: pis_relation >= 58
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 12; asylum_pis_commitment += 1; asylum_reform_progress += 8; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 8; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 2; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 5; news_headline = "Lewica converts PiS goodwill into humanitarian border access"

What PiS will trade is humanitarian access, never the doctrine behind the
fence. The channel is real; the cost is a partner who now considers the debt
between us settled.

- #poland_card_finish

@ministry
title: Make the Interior Ministry produce the procedure and staffing file
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Preparation +14.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 1 and (interior_minister_party = "Lewica" or foreign_minister_party = "Lewica")
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Interior or Foreign portfolio and one budget point.
view-if: asylum_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; asylum_reform_progress += 14; administrative_capacity += 2; migration_local_service_capacity += 4; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 8; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 7; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_left_ownership += 10; news_headline = "The Interior Ministry maps asylum casework, legal aid and reception places"

Casework deadlines, interpreter hours and reception places acquire numbers.
The border stops being a symbol and becomes an administration with a budget.

- #poland_card_finish

@palace
title: Put the border-law file before the President
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Presidential commitment +1; preparation +6.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace delegation needs one resource.
view-if: asylum_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.asylum_palace_president != Q.president_name) {
    Q.asylum_palace_commitment = 0;
    Q.asylum_palace_president = Q.president_name;
}
Q.asylum_palace_commitment += 1;
Q.asylum_reform_progress += 6;
Q.president_relation += 2;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 6;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 5;
Q.news_headline = "The Palace receives the asylum-procedure and legal-aid file";
!}

The Palace now owns a written account of what the current practice does at the
wire. On this field almost every President has a ceiling well below our goal,
and the file's job is to move the ceiling that exists rather than invent one.

- #poland_card_finish

@referendum
title: Ask the country for a lawful-procedure mandate
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. A very hard referendum on the Left's weakest field.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and resources >= 1 and asylum_reform_progress >= 35 and refugee_solidarity_support >= 48 and asylum_referendum_mandate = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Requires governing authority, one resource, 35 preparation and near-majority public support.
view-if: asylum_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
const variation =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 11) - 5;
Q.asylum_referendum_score = Math.round(
    14 + Number(Q.refugee_solidarity_support) * 0.45 +
    Number(Q.left_poll) * 0.45 +
    Number(Q.asylum_reform_progress) * 0.15 -
    Number(Q.refugee_solidarity_backlash) * 0.20 -
    Number(Q.migration_disinformation) * 0.12 +
    (Number(Q.asylum_ko_commitment) +
        Number(Q.asylum_third_way_commitment)) * 2 +
    variation
);
if (Q.asylum_referendum_score >= 50) {
    Q.asylum_referendum_mandate = 1;
    Q.asylum_reform_progress += 12;
    Q.progressive_credibility += 6;
    Q.public_trust += 2;
    Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_left_ownership += 10;
    Q.asylum_referendum_result = "A majority endorsed a lawful asylum procedure";
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 9;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_salience += 14;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 9;
Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support +=
    (Number(Q.public_climate_progressive_index) || 46.75) >= 48
        ? 11 : -9;
    Q.news_headline = "A national vote backs a lawful asylum procedure";
} else {
    Q.asylum_reform_progress = Math.max(
        Number(Q.asylum_reform_stage) * 20,
        Number(Q.asylum_reform_progress) - 8
    );
    Q.asylum_reform_proposal_stage =
        Number(Q.asylum_reform_goal_stage) || 4;
    Q.poland_asylum_reform_timer = 6;
    Q.public_trust -= 3;
    Q.public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 8;
    Q.asylum_referendum_result = "The reform mandate fell short";
    Q.news_headline = "The asylum referendum campaign falls short";
}
!}
go-to: referendum_result

@referendum_result
title: The referendum count
new-page: true

**Campaign score: [+ asylum_referendum_score +].** [+
asylum_referendum_result +].

[? if asylum_referendum_mandate: The hardest mandate in the campaign is now on
the record. Partners can still resist, but not by claiming the country forbids
it.?][? if not asylum_referendum_mandate: The defeat is expensive on a field
that was already hostile. The backlash hardens and the project needs six months.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@advance
title: Table the bill: [+ asylum_reform_next_label +]
subtitle: Requires government and passage power at or above the displayed threshold; veto players may force a narrower final settlement.
view-if: asylum_reform_defined = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and asylum_reform_power >= asylum_reform_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We either lack executive access or have not assembled enough coalition, public and presidential power.
on-arrival: reform_pressure_issue = "asylum"; reform_pressure_target_stage = asylum_reform_proposal_stage; reform_pressure_previous_stage = 0; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0; reform_pressure_referendum_used = 0
go-to: poland_major_reforms.resolve
